{"work_id":"raja-rani","scene_id":"raja-rani-s053","scene_ordinal":53,"transition_audit_id":"T053","source_scene_number":null,"source_scene_file":"works/raja-rani/scenes/scene-053.md","record_count":9,"records":[{"id":"raja-rani-s053-d001","scene_id":"raja-rani-s053","scene_ordinal":53,"transition_audit_id":"T053","speaker_label":"ஞானக்கண் குரல்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இந்த அப்பன் உனக்கு வேண்டுமானால் உன் மனதில் உள்ள கல்யாண ஆசையை விட்டுவிடு. கன்னிப் பெண்ணாகவே வாழு.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":73,"printed_page":72}],"source_scene_file":"scene-053.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s053-d002","scene_id":"raja-rani-s053","scene_ordinal":53,"transition_audit_id":"T053","speaker_label":"ராஜாவின் குரல்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"நீலிக்கண்ணீருக்கு இளகிவிடும் நெஞ்சம் எனக்குக் கிடையாது பாபு.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":73,"printed_page":72}],"source_scene_file":"scene-053.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s053-d003","scene_id":"raja-rani-s053","scene_ordinal":53,"transition_audit_id":"T053","speaker_label":"சாந்தம்மா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஏம்மா மின்னல் கொடி. மாயப்பொடி தூவுறியா மாயப்பொடி.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":73,"printed_page":72}],"source_scene_file":"scene-053.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s053-d004","scene_id":"raja-rani-s053","scene_ordinal":53,"transition_audit_id":"T053","speaker_label":"ஞான","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ராணி, “விதவையென்று தெரிந்தால் நீ யாரைக் காதலிக்கிறாயோ அவன் கூட உன்னை விரும்பமாட்டான்; அவன் கூட உன்னை விரும்பமாட்டான்....”","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":73,"printed_page":72}],"source_scene_file":"scene-053.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s053-d005","scene_id":"raja-rani-s053","scene_ordinal":53,"transition_audit_id":"T053","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"நீ விதவை என்பதைப்பற்றிக்கூட எனக்கு கவலையில்லை. ஆனால் இத்தனை நாள் என்னிடம் அதை மறைத்து வைத்து என்னை ஏமாற்றி இருக்கிறாய் பார். அதை யாராலும் மன்னிக்க முடியாது யாராலும் மன்னிக்க முடியாது.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":73,"printed_page":72}],"source_scene_file":"scene-053.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s053-d006","scene_id":"raja-rani-s053","scene_ordinal":53,"transition_audit_id":"T053","speaker_label":"ஞான","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"நீ விதவை.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":74,"printed_page":73}],"source_scene_file":"scene-053.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s053-d007","scene_id":"raja-rani-s053","scene_ordinal":53,"transition_audit_id":"T053","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"விதவை.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":74,"printed_page":73}],"source_scene_file":"scene-053.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s053-d008","scene_id":"raja-rani-s053","scene_ordinal":53,"transition_audit_id":"T053","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"வித்தாரக்கள்ளி! விநாசகாரி","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":74,"printed_page":73}],"source_scene_file":"scene-053.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s053-d009","scene_id":"raja-rani-s053","scene_ordinal":53,"transition_audit_id":"T053","speaker_label":"பல குரல்கள்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"விதவை! விதவை! விதவை! விதவை!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":74,"printed_page":73}],"source_scene_file":"scene-053.md"}]}